WEBVTT

00:01.000 --> 00:03.440
The fireworks went off.

00:03.560 --> 00:07.500
That tells us. But what did it sound like?

00:07.620 --> 00:12.990
Onomatopoeia is a word that sounds like the noise it names.

00:13.110 --> 00:16.360
Boom! The fireworks lit up the sky.

00:16.480 --> 00:18.780
Now we can hear it!

00:18.900 --> 00:23.180
Here is one more. Pop! The balloon burst.

00:23.300 --> 00:30.257
So look for a sound word, like boom or splash, and try one in your own writing!
